@startuml
title Customer Registration
autonumber
skinparam Style strictuml
skinparam SequenceMessageAlignment center
skinparam boxPadding 10

box "User" #E6F0FA
actor "Customer" as Customer
end box

box "Client" #E6F9E6
participant "DisputeX Web App" as Frontend
end box

box "DisputeX Backend" #FFF9E6
participant "DisputeX API" as Api
participant "Authentication Service" as Auth
participant "Token Service" as Token
end box

box "Data" #F2E6FF
database "Customer Store" as CustomerDB
database "Account Store" as AccountDB
end box

note over Api: Public endpoint - no token required

Customer -> Frontend: Complete registration form\n(first name, last name, email, password)
Frontend -> Api: Submit registration request

Api -> Auth: Register new customer
Auth -> CustomerDB: Check if email already registered
CustomerDB --> Auth: Result

alt #LightPink Email already registered
    Auth --> Api: Registration rejected (email in use)
    Api --> Frontend: Registration error
    Frontend --> Customer: Show error message
else #LightGreen New customer
    Auth -> Auth: Securely hash password
    Auth -> CustomerDB: Create customer record
    CustomerDB --> Auth: New customer identifier

    Auth -> AccountDB: Open default main account\n(ZAR, opening balance)
    AccountDB --> Auth: Account created

    Auth -> Token: Issue access token for customer
    Token --> Auth: Access token
    Auth --> Api: Registered (token + customer summary)
    Api --> Frontend: Registration successful (token returned)
    Frontend --> Customer: Redirect to dashboard
end
@enduml